WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:04.300
Never forget your poker face.

00:04.300 --> 00:06.090
With his father's teachings in his heart,

00:06.090 --> 00:08.520
the miraculous magician glides through skyscrapers.

00:08.520 --> 00:10.600
Enter Kaitō Kid!

00:10.600 --> 00:13.380
Today's target: The Dark Knights!

00:13.380 --> 00:15.170
Now, it's show time!

00:15.330 --> 00:20.330
kimi no namida ni kon’na ni koishite’ru

00:15.330 --> 00:20.330
I love your tears so much

00:20.330 --> 00:22.920
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

00:22.920 --> 00:26.500
soba de waratteitai yo

00:22.920 --> 00:26.500
I want to laugh by your side

00:34.050 --> 00:38.520
bōhatei atsui sunahama

00:34.050 --> 00:38.520
On a pier on a warm sandy beach

00:38.520 --> 00:43.770
machiwabita kiseki yatto otozureta

00:38.520 --> 00:43.770
The miracle I longed for finally came true

00:44.980 --> 00:49.110
dōka kono mama stay with me

00:44.980 --> 00:49.110
Please, stay with me, just like this

00:49.110 --> 00:52.570
Everything for you, I’ll always think of you

00:55.200 --> 00:59.240
hoshi furu yoru wa koishikute

00:55.200 --> 00:59.240
I miss the nights with shooting stars

00:59.240 --> 01:03.870
negai komete koe no kagiri utau no

00:59.240 --> 01:03.870
I wish and sing with all of my voice

01:05.130 --> 01:09.550
mō tomerarenai my sweet song

01:05.130 --> 01:09.550
I can’t stop my sweet song anymore

01:09.550 --> 01:15.050
nakisō na koe de I love you

01:09.550 --> 01:15.050
In a tearful voice I cry ‘I love you’

01:15.050 --> 01:19.510
koe ni naranai hodo hito o suki ni nari

01:15.050 --> 01:19.510
When you like someone so much that you can’t verbalise it

01:19.510 --> 01:22.100
Whoa, this summer day, summer night

01:22.100 --> 01:24.810
nanimo kamo ga takaramono

01:22.100 --> 01:24.810
Everything’s a treasure

01:24.810 --> 01:25.150
Baby...

01:25.150 --> 01:29.860
kimi no egao ga kon’na ni yūki kureru

01:25.150 --> 01:29.860
Your smile gives me so much courage

01:29.860 --> 01:35.200
hakanaku itoshii kono kimochi dakishimete

01:29.860 --> 01:35.200
as I embrace this fleeting love

01:35.200 --> 01:42.290
kimi no yokogao zutto zutto mitsumete’ta

01:35.200 --> 01:42.290
I’ve always, always been watching you from your side.

01:58.200 --> 02:02.950
Tears of Love for the Dark Knight

02:05.320 --> 02:06.750
Find him!

02:06.750 --> 02:10.490
Kaitō Kid has to be lurking somewhere nearby!

02:10.490 --> 02:14.220
Today, we'll finally smash
steel bracelets on both of his wrists!

02:14.220 --> 02:15.120
Yes, sir!

02:15.120 --> 02:17.350
What a mess...

02:17.350 --> 02:21.760
The weather forecast <i>did</i> say there'd be rain, but this is so much that I can't use my hangglider...

02:24.150 --> 02:27.600
You seem to be having trouble, Kaitō Kid-<i>kun</i>.

02:27.600 --> 02:30.690
Umm... Who am I speaking with?

02:30.690 --> 02:31.560
Me?

02:31.560 --> 02:35.220
My name is Nightmare...

02:35.220 --> 02:36.830
I am your ally.

02:42.440 --> 02:44.370
Nightmare?

02:44.370 --> 02:48.340
He's the one who helped Kid
get away, Superintendant Chaki?

02:48.340 --> 02:52.220
Yes. E-mails saying as much were delivered to two departments.

02:52.220 --> 02:55.530
'This time, I welcome Kaitō Kid as my ally.

02:55.530 --> 03:04.260
This coming Friday, at the Shūhō Art Museum, enjoy the nightmare that the two of us shall enact.'

03:04.260 --> 03:07.070
Just who is this guy?

03:07.070 --> 03:12.450
A man who wears a curious mask, and joins forces with thieves all over the world.

03:12.450 --> 03:17.220
In exchange for half of the spoils, he provides them with the necessary tricks and escape routes.

03:17.220 --> 03:20.950
He's a crime planner boasting a 100% success rate.

03:20.950 --> 03:23.450
But why would Kid work with a guy like that?!

03:23.450 --> 03:29.290
Those who carry out thefts with Nightmare are said to be released from the nightmares of this world

03:29.290 --> 03:31.870
and awarded with overflowing good luck.

03:31.870 --> 03:35.990
That's a rumour passed
between thieves as if it were true.

03:37.050 --> 03:41.490
Perhaps Kid has also been entranced by that good luck.

03:41.490 --> 03:46.200
Nakamori-<i>kun</i>, I guess you'll finally be released from your nightmare called Kid.

03:46.800 --> 03:53.950
This isn't public information, but thieves who've succeeded in commiting crimes with Nightmare

03:53.950 --> 04:00.130
have all either been arrested or shot by the local police before the night of the incident is over.

04:00.130 --> 04:03.740
In exchange for half the treasure, it is not good luck they gain, but death.

04:03.740 --> 04:08.300
W-What'd you say?! I want to
at least catch Kid alive...!

04:08.300 --> 04:11.890
However, we are not the only ones involved.

04:11.890 --> 04:13.660
He is under a Red Notice.

04:13.660 --> 04:16.080
By Red Notice, you can't mean...?

04:16.720 --> 04:23.640
An international notice seeking the location and arrest of a wanted person with a view to extradition.

04:23.640 --> 04:24.590
You mean...

04:24.590 --> 04:30.010
An investigator from the ICPO, a.k.a. Interpol is coming to get him.

04:32.950 --> 04:37.860
136 men at the front, 103 at the back, and 185 in the building.

04:37.860 --> 04:40.890
47 on the roof, and six helicopters.

04:40.890 --> 04:42.820
All officers are in place!

04:42.820 --> 04:45.770
Okay! Have everyone on alert!

04:45.770 --> 04:46.990
Don't let your guard down!

04:46.990 --> 04:51.330
We can't afford to be let down in front of Interpol by anyone yawning!

04:51.980 --> 04:52.410
Umm...

04:53.400 --> 04:55.100
Good to see you, Interpol!

04:55.100 --> 04:57.540
I am this crime scene's supervisor, Nakamori!

04:57.540 --> 04:59.060
Oh, it's just you, Kaito-<i>kun</i>?

04:59.060 --> 04:59.780
Yeah...

04:59.780 --> 05:01.440
I'm here since you called me.

05:01.440 --> 05:02.700
Oh, that's right!

05:02.700 --> 05:06.380
I wanted you to take a look at our anti-theft system, since you're used to magic tricks.

05:06.380 --> 05:09.890
Well then, shouldn't you have
called a more famous magician...?

05:09.890 --> 05:13.840
You were taught by your dad,
a world-famous magician, weren't you?

05:13.840 --> 05:19.690
And if it gets out that the police are so stumped by Kid that we're begging some magician to help, our reputation will plummet.

05:19.690 --> 05:22.040
Well then, I'll see you later.

05:22.040 --> 05:25.110
Well, I couldn't wish for anything more either.

05:25.110 --> 05:31.030
As Kaitō Kid's gonna know the secrets behind the trick before the show even starts.

05:31.030 --> 05:35.450
Well, well, is something wrong, Kaitō Kid-<i>kun</i>?

05:35.450 --> 05:37.120
Just kidding!

05:37.120 --> 05:39.640
Aoko?! What's with that outfit?

05:39.640 --> 05:44.490
I told the riot police I'd always wanted to try it on, so they gave me a spare!

05:44.490 --> 05:45.900
Not telling my dad, of course.

05:45.900 --> 05:49.820
Really...?! What were the guards here thinking?

05:49.820 --> 05:56.230
I wanted to show it to him too, but Dad's all enthusiastic so there's no point even if he turns up now.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.020
Hm? 'He'?

05:57.020 --> 06:00.600
Hey, Miss, are you fighting bad guys too?

06:01.690 --> 06:05.260
That's right! I'll catch them and beat 'em to a pulp!

06:05.260 --> 06:07.550
Evil never trimphs in this world!

06:07.550 --> 06:09.450
Then you're a friend of Dad's?!

06:09.450 --> 06:12.020
Dad...? Who are you?

06:12.020 --> 06:13.750
I'm Kenta Connery!

06:13.750 --> 06:19.870
Dad's a bigshot at Interpol who's always chasing a bad guy called Nightmare!

06:19.870 --> 06:23.790
Sorry I'm late. I'm Jack Connery from Interpol.

06:23.790 --> 06:24.990
You're alone?

06:24.990 --> 06:27.380
My subordinates are on standby outside.

06:27.380 --> 06:31.990
We're co-operating with your local police as we have no power of arrest.

06:31.990 --> 06:34.460
Even so, you speak Japanese very well, don't you?

06:34.460 --> 06:36.250
My wife was Japanese.

06:36.250 --> 06:38.310
Though she died three years ago.

06:38.310 --> 06:39.440
Dad!

06:39.440 --> 06:40.450
K-Kenta!

06:40.450 --> 06:42.770
Oh no, it's Dad!

06:42.770 --> 06:44.050
What are you doing here?

06:44.050 --> 06:50.150
I heard you were coming back to Japan, Dad, so I've been hiding in the museum's toilets since this evening!

06:50.150 --> 06:51.990
W-What'd you say?!

06:51.990 --> 06:55.080
Full of holes, just like I thought. This is gonna be easy.

06:55.080 --> 06:58.490
But isn't everybody going to be worried about you?

06:58.490 --> 07:01.500
It's fine, I told them I was staying at your hotel.

07:01.500 --> 07:03.040
Ah, I'm in trouble...

07:03.040 --> 07:06.220
I don't have time to escort him back...

07:06.220 --> 07:07.280
Huh? I'm going home?!

07:07.280 --> 07:08.530
Then I'll take him!

07:09.420 --> 07:10.710
You are?

07:10.710 --> 07:12.370
My daughter, Aoko.

07:12.370 --> 07:15.070
She delivers me lunch and things.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.540
That was a quick change...

07:16.540 --> 07:17.850
Where to?

07:17.850 --> 07:20.380
The orphanage that's looking after him.

07:21.490 --> 07:27.400
My job requires me to fly all around the world, and since my wife died, I haven't had time to care for him.

07:27.400 --> 07:30.700
Then since you offered, could you please handle it?

07:30.700 --> 07:31.320
Sure!

07:31.890 --> 07:33.240
Let's go, Kenta-<i>kun</i>!

07:33.240 --> 07:37.160
Mr. Connery, your subordinates are calling for you.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.400
Understood.

07:38.400 --> 07:41.740
Then I'll leave Nightmare to you, Inspector Nakamori.

07:41.740 --> 07:46.210
You can count on me! I'll tie him and Kid up together.

07:46.210 --> 07:50.670
Let's both hurry and lift the weights we've carried for so long from our backs.

07:50.670 --> 07:51.970
Right...

07:51.970 --> 07:53.880
Ah, one more thing.

07:53.880 --> 07:57.520
What sort of guy is Nightmare really?

07:57.520 --> 07:59.090
Let's see...

07:59.090 --> 08:02.810
In the words of the thieves who survived helping him and were arrested,

08:02.810 --> 08:10.730
Nightmare creeps into people's hearts, sees everything, and controls them at will. He's a devious demon.

08:10.730 --> 08:12.700
Demon?

08:12.700 --> 08:15.660
A demon who controls people's hearts...

08:15.660 --> 08:18.510
He may be right about that...

08:22.000 --> 08:25.180
So? Was it to your satisfaction?

08:25.180 --> 08:27.960
The escape route that I selected.

08:27.960 --> 08:34.510
Just what I expected from the perfect crime planner famous in the underworld, Nightmare.

08:34.510 --> 08:37.450
Oh, you've heard of me?

08:37.450 --> 08:39.950
Then I'll make this quick. This coming Frid—

08:39.950 --> 08:40.850
Oh no!

08:40.850 --> 08:42.930
Sorry, but I'm not teaming up with you.

08:42.930 --> 08:44.900
Is that so...?

08:44.900 --> 08:47.940
Then just as the rumours say, you're a lone wolf.

08:47.940 --> 08:51.370
No, actually, you have one friend.

08:51.370 --> 08:54.820
An old man who sometimes impersonates you and helps you escape.

08:54.820 --> 08:55.750
What?!

08:55.750 --> 08:58.200
I like magic, see...

08:58.200 --> 09:04.270
Eight years ago, a world-famous magician I was a fan of left this world, and Kid vanished too.

09:04.270 --> 09:12.470
I had thought that magician was Kid, but seeing him make a return after eight years, I was suspicious of his attendant.

09:12.470 --> 09:16.140
However, the years have taken their toll on him, so he couldn't have managed a single crime...

09:16.140 --> 09:17.020
Jii-<i>chan</i>...

09:17.680 --> 09:20.180
So I hypothesised.

09:20.180 --> 09:26.720
Perhaps he found a new master, and they began work as the second Kid.

09:26.720 --> 09:31.110
What do you think? Don't you think the police would be pleased by this hypothesis— I mean, information...

09:31.110 --> 09:32.460
Stop! That's enough!

09:33.650 --> 09:35.950
I trust you understand?

09:35.950 --> 09:38.450
You cannot escape from me.

09:38.450 --> 09:41.890
You are always under my control.

09:41.890 --> 09:44.050
Yes... Even now.

09:49.290 --> 09:50.940
Nightmare...

09:52.400 --> 09:53.710
Then what's our goal?

09:57.470 --> 10:03.890
These are the earrings with black opals embedded in them that Nightmare and Kid are after, the 'Dark Knights'.

10:03.890 --> 10:08.190
I guess I can't check if they're Pandora without moonlight after all...

10:08.190 --> 10:14.270
And to stop them, this is the Kid-proof anti-theft system we developed.

10:15.110 --> 10:22.250
To open that case with toughened glass on each side, the chains, through which a high-voltage current flows, must be taken off.

10:22.250 --> 10:24.030
Don't you think it's unbeatable?

10:24.030 --> 10:29.640
I see... And the case is floating to stop the case itself being hidden, right?

10:29.640 --> 10:32.700
That's right. You're great, Kaito-<i>kun</i>.

10:32.700 --> 10:34.180
I was right to ask you...

10:36.950 --> 10:40.350
By the way, what's that liquid in the case?

10:40.350 --> 10:43.100
I can see the pedestal in the middle is where the jewels'll be placed.

10:43.100 --> 10:47.390
It's water. Black opals
are sensitive to dryness.

10:47.390 --> 10:50.000
Isn't that right, Director Kondō?!

10:50.000 --> 10:54.050
The director said that he can't fight on an empty stomach, so he went to have dinner...

10:54.050 --> 10:57.030
W-What?! This late...?

10:57.030 --> 11:01.850
So it's a 48 centimetre square, and a 16 centimetre diameter in the middle, huh?

11:01.850 --> 11:04.410
So how about it, Kaito-<i>kun</i>?
What do you think of this system?

11:05.550 --> 11:08.830
I don't think they'll be stolen, as long as you don't open the lid!

11:11.750 --> 11:14.380
Huh? Aoko, you're still here?

11:14.380 --> 11:15.420
Well...

11:16.260 --> 11:20.280
Look, you can leave it to your dad and my father...

11:20.280 --> 11:22.430
No! I wanna fight too!

11:22.430 --> 11:24.770
I'll beat up the bad guys with Dad!

11:24.770 --> 11:26.600
I'm gonna be just like Dad!

11:27.510 --> 11:29.090
Ah, what happened?

11:29.090 --> 11:30.310
Kenta-<i>kun</i>?

11:30.310 --> 11:32.430
I'm fine... I've got medicine...

11:32.940 --> 11:36.100
Aren't those just painkillers?!

11:36.100 --> 11:43.610
The doctor said there's a bad guy living in my head, and they have to operate...

11:43.610 --> 11:46.330
Operate? You mean...

11:46.330 --> 11:50.690
I'll be fine! Dad told me that if Nightmare was gone,

11:50.690 --> 11:54.370
the bad horse rampaging around my head'll be chased out!

11:54.370 --> 11:58.950
And then I'll always be able to live with him, he said!

12:02.400 --> 12:04.560
Oh? You hungry?

12:04.560 --> 12:08.220
Then how about eating curry rice at a family restaurant with me?

12:08.220 --> 12:12.070
If you have some carrots, maybe that nasty horse'll behave himself.

12:12.070 --> 12:12.810
R-Right...

12:13.440 --> 12:15.800
Talking about horses, did you see <i>him</i> here?

12:15.800 --> 12:17.770
Like I said, who?

12:17.770 --> 12:22.030
That's odd... He sent me an e-mail asking me to tell you.

12:22.030 --> 12:23.950
'I'm looking forward to meeting you at the scene!'

12:23.950 --> 12:26.660
Hey, you don't mean...

12:29.230 --> 12:31.870
Is this really okay, young master?

12:31.870 --> 12:36.790
Today even an evildoer with a terrifying name is involved.

12:36.790 --> 12:38.840
Did you know, nanny?

12:38.840 --> 12:41.840
A black horse symbolises a nightmare.

12:41.840 --> 12:44.730
Yes, I am aware.

12:44.730 --> 12:47.990
In chess terms, a black horse is the second player's knight.

12:47.990 --> 12:53.680
(white horse)

12:47.990 --> 12:53.680
So until the first player's knight is standing on the board, which would be myself, Saguru Hakuba, the game cannot begin.

12:57.810 --> 13:00.650
Six helicopters are glaring down from the skies.

13:00.650 --> 13:04.150
472 riot police members have been deployed.

13:04.150 --> 13:06.260
You're certainly well informed.

13:06.260 --> 13:09.580
I've intercepted the radios and hacked the anti-theft systems.

13:09.580 --> 13:13.310
In other terms, I can freely view all of the police's information.

13:14.500 --> 13:17.790
Normally, this is when I'd guide you through everything from breaking in

13:17.790 --> 13:23.590
to the escape route which I've selected, but for you, I don't need to.

13:23.590 --> 13:29.510
Yeah, I'll make sure to get it, so fluff up your pillows and have some nice dreams while you wait!

13:31.660 --> 13:33.600
Nightmare-<i>san</i>...

13:45.070 --> 13:47.450
Inspector! Director Kondō has returned.

13:47.910 --> 13:49.890
You're late, director.

13:49.890 --> 13:52.810
There's only 30 minutes until Kid's scheduled time!

13:52.810 --> 13:55.750
Oh, sorry. How's it going?

13:55.750 --> 13:58.810
We're just about to seal the jewels in that case.

13:58.810 --> 14:00.000
Begin!

14:00.000 --> 14:01.670
Ah, wait a second.

14:01.670 --> 14:04.050
Let me check the case again, just to be sure.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.470
Oh?

14:08.160 --> 14:10.390
Something's floating in the water.

14:10.390 --> 14:14.070
It's probably dust from when the chains were fixed to the ceiling.

14:14.070 --> 14:17.600
So that's it. Ah, it seems there's no problem then.

14:17.600 --> 14:19.310
Well then, put the jewels on the pedestal.

14:21.870 --> 14:24.650
Then I just place on the glass lid...

14:24.650 --> 14:26.070
Whoops!

14:26.070 --> 14:28.250
Ah, my age is getting to me.

14:28.250 --> 14:31.660
Geez... Okay, attach the chains and pull up the case.

14:35.790 --> 14:37.500
Finishing touches are done.

14:37.500 --> 14:41.320
Now if I can just get Hakuba to fall into my trap...

14:44.400 --> 14:49.580
I do apologise, young master. And it's right in front of us!

14:49.580 --> 14:51.720
Nanny, why did you take this route?

14:51.720 --> 14:57.730
When we were at the petrol station earlier, an e-mail from Inspector Nakamori arrived.

14:57.730 --> 15:04.150
When I called the number in it, I got some nice info saying that this road was the quickest way.

15:04.150 --> 15:06.530
Nanny, that was Kaitō Kid.

15:07.800 --> 15:12.570
He used the Inspector's voice to guide us onto a packed road to slow me down.

15:13.300 --> 15:15.490
Oh, I was foolish.

15:15.490 --> 15:20.200
Don't worry. I realised our
unfortunate inconvenience in time.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.290
I'll go on foot.

15:21.290 --> 15:23.000
Y-Young master!

15:25.920 --> 15:26.930
Yes, Nakamori he-

15:26.930 --> 15:29.470
Inspector Nakamori, it's Saguru Hakuba!

15:29.470 --> 15:30.410
Hakuba-<i>kun</i>?!

15:30.410 --> 15:32.320
Inspector, what's the situation there?!

15:32.320 --> 15:35.850
Situation? Nothing's happened yet...

15:35.850 --> 15:39.520
Isn't this room a little too dark?

15:39.520 --> 15:42.390
I just adjusted the lights.

15:42.390 --> 15:50.030
Opals are six to ten percent water, so they crack if they dry out, and shouldn't be subjected to bright lights either.

15:50.030 --> 15:54.290
Well, I <i>have</i> heard of that. But still, this is a bit...

15:54.290 --> 15:59.410
Yes, it's almost as if the darkness
is asking for them to be taken...

16:00.280 --> 16:02.060
I-Inspector! The lights...!

16:02.060 --> 16:04.290
Calm down! Switch to the backup generator!

16:04.290 --> 16:06.500
T-The jewels!

16:06.500 --> 16:08.730
I-It can't be!

16:09.710 --> 16:12.130
What, they're there, aren't they?

16:12.130 --> 16:13.840
They're floating on the water?!

16:13.840 --> 16:18.260
The specific gravity of opal is 2.10-2.13! They shouldn't float!

16:18.260 --> 16:20.460
Then you're saying they're fakes?!

16:20.460 --> 16:23.930
A-Anyway, we have to check, so remove the chains and lid!

16:23.930 --> 16:26.150
Ah, wait! Don't touch anything until I get th...

16:26.150 --> 16:27.860
We can't wait for you!

16:27.860 --> 16:29.070
Bloody hell!

16:30.780 --> 16:34.300
T-This is a fake!

16:34.300 --> 16:36.490
Damn you, Kid!

16:36.490 --> 16:40.240
Connery, just now the jewels were reported have been stolen by Kid!

16:40.240 --> 16:42.600
So they couldn't stop him after all.

16:42.600 --> 16:43.810
But don't worry.

16:43.810 --> 16:46.170
I know the pattern of Kid's partner, Nightmare.

16:46.170 --> 16:49.880
Have everyone follow my orders swiftly to chase them!

16:49.880 --> 16:50.630
Understood!

16:55.930 --> 16:57.390
Ah, it's Dad!

16:58.000 --> 17:00.440
Mr. Driver, follow that car!

17:00.440 --> 17:01.810
You can't do that!

17:01.810 --> 17:04.280
There's something I've gotta tell Dad!

17:04.280 --> 17:07.810
The people running the orphanage found a doctor who'll fix my head!

17:07.810 --> 17:12.860
So he shouldn't go worrying about me, but go fight bad guys with all his strength!

17:12.860 --> 17:16.200
At least let me tell Dad that, please!

17:19.070 --> 17:20.780
It's pointless.

17:20.780 --> 17:24.060
Kid switched out the jewels before the crime.

17:24.060 --> 17:30.710
During the power cut he tilted the case to make them float, making fools of us for protecting fakes.

17:30.710 --> 17:32.420
It's strange.

17:32.420 --> 17:34.130
Strange? What is?

17:34.130 --> 17:39.840
Normally, if you tilted a case with this much water in, the marks should've come up much higher.

17:39.840 --> 17:42.390
But there's only very slight marks.

17:42.390 --> 17:46.050
Which means that it was only slightly tilted, and the water didn't move much.

17:46.050 --> 17:46.480
Basically...

17:46.480 --> 17:48.400
H-Hey, what're you...?

17:49.590 --> 17:50.610
What's that?

17:50.610 --> 17:52.320
A transparent acrylic sheet.

17:53.030 --> 17:55.390
Small stoppers were fixed at the case's four corners,

17:55.390 --> 18:00.120
and an acrylic sheet was lowered to catch on them, to make the water shallower.

18:00.120 --> 18:02.910
So the jewels would look like they're floating.

18:02.910 --> 18:05.230
W-What? Then the jewels...

18:05.230 --> 18:07.580
Were the real thing, of course.

18:07.580 --> 18:08.830
Which means...

18:11.170 --> 18:13.960
I-Inspector! Director Kondō was put to sleep in the toilet!

18:13.960 --> 18:17.060
It's Kid! Kid's disguised as the director and has the jewels!

18:17.060 --> 18:19.630
The Dark Knights! Chase him! It's an emergency!

18:21.800 --> 18:27.230
He's likely already removed his disguise, and is flying through the night sky with those white wings.

18:35.730 --> 18:37.570
Well, that was a sight.

18:37.570 --> 18:40.880
I was right to choose you, Kaitō Kid.

18:40.880 --> 18:44.620
From now on, unbelievably good luck will come your way.

18:44.620 --> 18:46.200
I don't need any.

18:47.150 --> 18:50.110
Hmm? We were to split the treasure between us.

18:50.110 --> 18:52.880
In the end, they weren't what I was looking for.

18:55.500 --> 18:56.460
A miss, huh?

18:56.460 --> 19:01.130
Pandora, the stone of life that the Organisation that killed my dad is after isn't in here...

19:01.130 --> 19:06.560
There are times that Kaitō Kid returns jewels he's gone to great lengths to steal.

19:06.560 --> 19:07.880
Just as I was informed.

19:07.880 --> 19:12.060
Didn't you hear about that and about the security measures straight from the Japanese police?

19:12.060 --> 19:12.770
What?

19:12.770 --> 19:14.480
Isn't that right?

19:14.480 --> 19:17.280
Jack Connery-<i>san</i> from Interpol.

19:19.190 --> 19:20.700
What're you saying?

19:20.700 --> 19:23.730
That was from hacking the anti-theft systems and intercepting the radios...

19:23.730 --> 19:25.450
Then why was your number wrong?

19:25.450 --> 19:26.500
Number?

19:26.500 --> 19:28.830
Front: 136.
Back: 103.

19:28.830 --> 19:33.170
Inside: 185. Roof: 47. Total: 471.

19:33.170 --> 19:34.880
Your count was one too high.

19:34.880 --> 19:39.300
As you counted a girl messing about
in a riot police uniform too.

19:40.390 --> 19:42.560
It wasn't hacking nor interception.

19:42.560 --> 19:45.050
You counted them yourself when you were there.

19:47.760 --> 19:51.640
While flying around the world, I find them sometimes.

19:51.640 --> 19:58.660
Stupid police branches, who out of competitiveness and vanity, intentionally misreport their numbers to Interpol.

19:59.630 --> 20:04.570
So I counted them myself, but this
time it had the opposite effect.

20:04.570 --> 20:08.890
So you've been getting rid of partners
who realised who you were?

20:08.890 --> 20:12.890
Yes. I team with thieves whose countries can't handle them.

20:12.890 --> 20:16.500
And in exchange for them taking the credit, me shooting them 'never happened'.

20:17.300 --> 20:22.200
It seems that my subordinates have brought the local police here, as I instructed them.

20:22.200 --> 20:26.430
To retrieve the corpse of the stupid thief who obtained half of the treasure.

20:26.430 --> 20:32.390
Don't you think it's odd that I still came here despite knowing your identity?

20:32.390 --> 20:32.930
What?

20:32.930 --> 20:34.850
If Nightmare was gone...

20:34.850 --> 20:39.380
The bad horse rampaging around my head'll be chased out!

20:39.380 --> 20:43.070
And then I'll always be able to live with him!

20:43.070 --> 20:47.840
When you get the enormous costs for his surgery, you'll retire as Nightmare.

20:47.840 --> 20:48.950
Isn't that what you meant?

20:48.950 --> 20:50.580
K-Kenta...

20:50.580 --> 20:53.400
But in the end you're just an amateur among thieves.

20:53.400 --> 20:59.000
The treasures you obtain you sell too cheaply, and if you kept all the loot for yourself, nobody'd team up with you.

21:00.710 --> 21:04.590
Give it up. For Kenta's sake.

21:04.590 --> 21:07.260
You came all the way here to say that...?

21:07.260 --> 21:10.680
I couldn't help it after hearing that...

21:11.520 --> 21:13.570
I'm gonna be just like Dad!

21:16.390 --> 21:19.860
I can't... I can't... I can't! I'm almost there!

21:19.860 --> 21:23.470
So I have to keep giving thieves nightmares!

21:23.470 --> 21:24.570
Wearing this!

21:25.740 --> 21:27.110
Dad!

21:27.110 --> 21:29.370
K-Kenta!

21:34.660 --> 21:35.660
Dad?!

21:35.660 --> 21:37.580
Wait, why're you here?!

21:37.580 --> 21:39.350
Well, he saw...

21:41.920 --> 21:42.950
D-Drop them!

21:45.380 --> 21:47.750
Hurry up and drop the jewels!

21:47.750 --> 21:50.970
I can't! They're for Kenta! Kenta's surgery!

21:55.640 --> 21:57.580
Dad?

21:57.580 --> 21:59.270
Dad!

22:01.560 --> 22:02.290
Ken...

22:04.800 --> 22:06.860
I'm gonna be just like Dad!

22:09.850 --> 22:10.490
Dad!

22:11.200 --> 22:12.950
Dad? Dad!

22:12.950 --> 22:14.700
Dad?!

22:13.370 --> 22:14.700
Oh no...

22:14.700 --> 22:18.080
How could this happen...
Did he fall while trying to protect the jewels?

22:18.080 --> 22:21.750
It seems that Kid was trying to save this bloke.

22:22.600 --> 22:25.460
So that's it! Nightmare's real identity is...

22:25.460 --> 22:27.170
And Kid, you...

22:27.170 --> 22:31.640
So they broke up and ran off, leaving the treasure behind?

22:31.640 --> 22:35.570
No, he stole it.

22:35.570 --> 22:39.940
He stole from this child the nightmare known as truth...

22:51.110 --> 22:56.660
kimi ni zenzen kyōmi nai uso you are my perfect guy

22:51.110 --> 22:56.660
I’m not interested in you at all — I’m lying, you are my perfect guy

22:56.660 --> 23:01.410
tokimeki wa kakusenai honto wa ki ni natte shikatanai

22:56.660 --> 23:01.410
I can’t hide my beating heart, I’m really into you, I can’t help it

23:01.410 --> 23:06.380
koi ni bukiyō son'na style kimi no mae da to betsujin mitai

23:01.410 --> 23:06.380
I’m no good at love, with a bad style, I become someone else when facing you

23:06.380 --> 23:11.460
dare ni mo ienai himitsu no mama

23:06.380 --> 23:11.460
I don’t tell anyone about it

23:11.460 --> 23:16.140
soredemo I'm all right koi no yukue nante

23:11.460 --> 23:16.140
Still, I’m all right, love just isn’t for me

23:16.140 --> 23:20.720
mada it isn't the last chance for me

23:16.140 --> 23:20.720
and it still isn’t the last chance for me

23:20.720 --> 23:25.900
iron'na love story o egaite'ru mune no naka

23:20.720 --> 23:25.900
I have many love stories carved into my heart

23:25.900 --> 23:31.570
demo risō ni wa hodo tōi

23:25.900 --> 23:31.570
but they’re far from my ideals

23:31.570 --> 23:36.570
watashi-tte wagamama sore kurai no koto wakatte'ru

23:31.570 --> 23:36.570
I know I’m selfish but…

23:36.570 --> 23:43.290
dakedo nanika ikenai no?

23:36.570 --> 23:43.290
…is there anything wrong with that?

23:43.290 --> 23:48.460
kimi to no koi ni koi o shite'ru dake de

23:43.290 --> 23:48.460
Just being in love with you is enough

23:48.460 --> 23:53.420
tsutaetakutemo mada

23:48.460 --> 23:53.420
I couldn’t confess even if I wanted to…

23:53.420 --> 23:58.510
himitsu ni shite'ru hō ga shiawase dakara

23:53.420 --> 23:58.510
I’m happier with it being a secret

23:58.510 --> 24:06.230
ima wa watashi dake no secret love

23:58.510 --> 24:06.230
so for now, it’ll be my secret love
